ely. Where appropriate, examples are used effectively. There is evidence of appropriate synthesis or evaluation. There are no significant errors.","questionText":"1. (a) Explain why governments impose price floors in the market for agricultural products.\b [10] (b) Evaluate the effectiveness of government regulations in achieving a reduction in the consumption of demerit goods.\b [15]"},"secondarySubtopics":["Demerit goods","Externality policy instruments"],"secondaryTopicIds":[],"secondaryTopics":[],"session":"May","skills":["skill.analysis_chain_of_reasoning","skill.application_to_context","skill.diagram_construct","skill.diagram_explain","skill.economic_terminology","skill.evaluation_tradeoffs","skill.explanation_causal_chain","skill.knowledge_definition"],"solutionStatus":"Official IB markscheme image with extracted accessible transcript","sourceId":"ib-economics-hl:2021-may-tz1-hl-p1-q01","sourceLevels":["HL"],"sourceMarkSchemeUrl":"https://ibdocs.re/p/IB%20PAST%20PAPERS%20-%20YEAR/2021%20Examination%20Session/May%202021%20Examination%20Session/Individuals%20and%20societies/Economics_paper_1__TZ1_HL_markscheme.pdf","sourceQuestionUrl":"https://ibdocs.re/p/IB%20PAST%20PAPERS%20-%20YEAR/2021%20Examination%20Session/May%202021%20Examination%20Session/Individuals%20and%20societies/Economics_paper_1__TZ1_HL.pdf","sourceType":"actual_past_paper","sourceUrl":"https://ibdocs.re/p/IB%20PAST%20PAPERS%20-%20YEAR/2021%20Examination%20Session/May%202021%20Examination%20Session/Individuals%20and%20societies/Economics_paper_1__TZ1_HL.pdf","subject":"Economics","subpartEvidence":[{"detailed_subtopic_ids":["content.microeconomics.demerit-goods","content.microeconomics.externality-policy-instruments","content.microeconomics.price-floors"],"part_id":"(b)"},{"detailed_subtopic_ids":["content.microeconomics.price-floors"],"part_id":"(a)"}],"subtopics":["Price floors","Demerit goods","Externality policy instruments"],"summary":"1. (a) Explain why governments impose price floors in t