sis or evaluation that is mostly balanced. 9–10 • The response identifies and fully explains an appropriate policy. • The response uses relevant economic theory effectively to support the recommendation. • Relevant economic terms are used appropriately throughout the response. • The use of information from the text/data is appropriate, relevant and supports the analysis/evaluation effectively. • The response contains evidence of effective and balanced synthesis or evaluation.","markschemeUrl":"https://ibdocs.re/p/IB%20PAST%20PAPERS%20-%20YEAR/2023%20Examination%20Session/May%202023%20Examination%20Session/Individuals%20and%20societies/Economics_paper_3__HL_markscheme.pdf","maxMarks":30,"number":2,"officialCodes":[{"canonical_id":"new_first_assessment_2022/4.5","concept_level_applicability":"SL_and_HL","curriculum_era":"new_first_assessment_2022","normalized_detail_id":null,"official_code":"4.5","source_levels":["HL"]},{"canonical_id":"new_first_assessment_2022/3.1","concept_level_applicability":"SL_and_HL","curriculum_era":"new_first_assessment_2022","normalized_detail_id":null,"official_code":"3.1","source_levels":["HL"]},{"canonical_id":"new_first_assessment_2022/3.3","concept_level_applicability":"SL_and_HL","curriculum_era":"new_first_assessment_2022","normalized_detail_id":null,"official_code":"3.3","source_levels":["HL"]}],"officialEra":"new_first_assessment_2022","officialMarkscheme":{"imageHashes":["3389c76d68d505962ac4a496c6cc540ee1df8e1e98c1a91b5073f6ced7825644","7982ccb1abf566306e0fd8867e4a46edae71ee4e8829ba325953e7530081cfef","5f92881c2d3c08bcfa0acacc00eb7b403668f5afaa488bfff4afc05f3edf3790","f353c1549609477000840dd520fc8ab7a69f6202a7f3a4048e77b4e6500ad6dd","4e49b4e849bb1289033145580e1cda03663bd90b27f2a1c872932f3cd350f84f","88be619ccf585b3397e5090ddd3bc6297ec9be9f00d055f7d396366b71795db1","fc9d0cdd3f73bbfb48dd813ca2c5d7dd62d09573eb96c79bc2fccb75ff716cb8","9f3b59ee680cb01ef3dfa3b94fcb0766a97bf26f4a23715ddcb7586d2d89b204"],"images":["markschemes/2023-may-n